00:25:43.150 --> 00:25:44.140
we want to hear from you.

00:25:44.140 --> 00:25:45.640
MARK MANDEL: Mo, got
anything else to add?

00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:47.181
MO FIROUZ: Yeah,
just one last thing,

00:25:47.181 --> 00:25:50.540
which I think Alim missed out
is part all of this stuff--

00:25:50.540 --> 00:25:52.570
I think next week
