00:26:16.440 --> 00:26:17.680
We're here to stay.

00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:19.900
This is the stability marker,
and we're super excited

00:26:19.900 --> 00:26:21.310
moving forward to have it.

00:26:21.310 --> 00:26:22.643
FRANCESC CAMPOY: That's awesome.

00:26:22.643 --> 00:26:25.510
Well, congratulations,
