00:26:33.172 --> 00:26:33.880
We learned a lot.

00:26:33.880 --> 00:26:34.180
ALIM JAFFER: Yeah.

00:26:34.180 --> 00:26:35.470
Thanks for having us, guys.

00:26:35.470 --> 00:26:35.800
MO FIROUZ: Definitely.

00:26:35.800 --> 00:26:36.620
Thanks for having us.

00:26:36.620 --> 00:26:37.995
MARK MANDEL: Thank
